000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TBALWOFF.
000400 AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         FEB 25, 1987.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL CREATE AN ACCOUNTING
000900*                      ADJUSTMENT FOR ALL CODES WHICH END THE
001000*                      MONTH WITH A DOLLAR BALANCE BUT NO UNIT
001100*                      BALANCE.  THESE ADJUSTMENTS WILL BE CHARGED
001200*                      TO THE DEFAULT DEPT AND ACCOUNT RELATED
001300*                      TO THE CODE.  A REPORT WILL BE PRINTED
001400*                      ITEMIZING EACH OF THESE ADJUSTMENTS.
      *C
      *C   07FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   11/08/1994   CATHY ZUBEK     REQ. #: 6231
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO VALIDATE THE DEPARTMENT USING MCHT-ACCTS
      *C     PRIOR TO WRITING AADJ RECORDS TO DTRANS.  IF NO DEPARTMENT
      *C     IS FOUND, ZEROES WILL BE MOVED TO THE FIELD AND A MESSAGE
      *C     WILL BE DISPLAYED.
      *C
      *C   12SEP1996    DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
001600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
001900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
002100
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MMATL-ACCUM-MC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DTRANS-MC-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO-IK-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MCHT-ACCTS-DP-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

