022100*******************************************************
022200*   PARAMETERS USED IN 'TBLOWUP' ROUTINE (PRINTS      *
022300*   ERRORS AND ABORTS PROGRAM.  RUN XBLPRT.OBJECT TO  *
022400*   READ ERRORS).                                     *
022500*******************************************************
